  constraints.rigid_water     True   (set)

Input interpretation
--------------------
  interpreted as              single-molecule SDF
  coordinates                 supplied by the SDF, used as given (no embedding, no minimisation)
  residue name                ETA   (stated)
  small-molecule FF           sage-2.2.1
  solvent treatment           explicit TIP3P, periodic
  protein FF                  not used
  water FF                    amber14/tip3p.xml

Preparation
-----------
  ligand       : [H]C([H])([H])C([H])([H])[H]
  parameters   : LOCAL-OTMSDBZUPAUEDD/param_cf41a2bd76f4 (reused (stated reference))
  protonation  : pH 7.0, 6 -> 6 hydrogens
  solvation    : 620 waters, ions {}, box cube (19.7 nm^3)
  box geometry : requested 1.35 nm padding -> solute-to-copy clearance 2.39336 nm, reduced-box height 2.7 nm (needs 1.9 nm for a 0.9 nm cutoff)
  system       : PME, cutoff 0.9 nm, switching False, dispersion correction True, Ewald tolerance 0.0005, HBonds

